Package: baloo6
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Breaks: baloo-kf5 (<< 5.115.0-3~)
Replaces: baloo-kf5 (<< 5.115.0-3~)
Description: framework for file search and metadata management
 Baloo is the file indexing and file search framework for KDE Plasma. It
 focuses on speed and a very small memory footprint. It maintains an index of
 your files and optionally their contents which you can search.
 .
 This package contains the runtime service and baloo control binaries.

